# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 11. DONS — MaxiCash PayEntryWeb (redirection web)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 📱 [FIDELE] Initier un don (retourne l'URL de la passerelle MaxiCash)
POST {{graphql_url}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "query": "mutation InitierDon($input: InitierDonInput!) { initierDon(input: $input) { transactionId reference paymentUrl statut } }",
  "variables": {
    "input": {
      "montant": 5000,
      "devise": "CDF",
      "message": "Offrande culte du dimanche",
      "telephone": "+243991234567"
    }
  }
}

### 📱 [FIDELE] Vérifier le statut après retour WebView
POST {{graphql_url}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "query": "query GetDonParReference($reference: String!) { getDonParReference(reference: $reference) { id montant devise statut reference updatedAt } }",
  "variables": {
    "reference": "LPE-DON-REMPLACER_PAR_REFERENCE"
  }
}

### 📱 [FIDELE] Historique de mes dons
POST {{graphql_url}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "query": "query GetMesDons($limit: Int, $offset: Int) { getMesDons(limit: $limit, offset: $offset) { totalCount items { id montant devise statut reference message createdAt } } }",
  "variables": {
    "limit": 20,
    "offset": 0
  }
}

### 🔒 [ADMIN] Liste des dons reçus
POST {{graphql_url}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "query": "query GetDonsAdmin($statut: StatutDon, $limit: Int, $offset: Int) { getDonsAdmin(statut: $statut, limit: $limit, offset: $offset) { totalCount items { id montant devise statut reference telephonePayeur createdAt } } }",
  "variables": {
    "statut": null,
    "limit": 50,
    "offset": 0
  }
}

### 🌐 [PUBLIC] Page de retour succès (ouverte par MaxiCash après paiement)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/dons/retour/success?reference=LPE-DON-EXEMPLE

### 🌐 [PUBLIC] Webhook notify MaxiCash (appelé par MaxiCash, pas le mobile)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/dons/maxicash/notify?reference=LPE-DON-EXEMPLE&Status=success


